            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Here we present our Fracture Knowledgebase as a environment for finding information about fractures and faults. The knowledgebase features the research outcome of the Stanford Rock Fracture Project for the past 20 years, including mechanisms of fracturing and faulting, and the geometry and distribution characteristic of fractures and faults based on their mechanism.",
